March 30, 2014
SREF V3.2.21
An error was found in the smartinit downscaled Probability of Precipitation outputs over CONUS.
The input SREF Probability of Precip CONUS (Grid 212) GRIB files were incorrectly interpolated to the 
CONUS 5 and 2.5 km NDFD grids.  The output grid definitions used by copygb to interpolate SREF
probability files weere incorrectly configured.  The correction was made to the ush/nam_smartinit.sh 
grid variable definition for CONUS Lambert Conformal output downscaled grids.

The SPA need only copy ush/nam_smartinit.sh to implement this correction.
See https://svnemc.ncep.noaa.gov/projects/smartinit/tags/RB-3.2.22/ush/nam_smartinit.sh
